    enRows:[["Konjunktionaladverbien","verb in 2nd position — deshalb/deswegen (so/therefore), trotzdem (nevertheless)"],["Subjunktionen","verb goes to the END of the clause — weil, dass, damit, obwohl, seit/seitdem, bis"],["obwohl in first position","if the obwohl-clause comes first, the main clause's verb comes right after the comma"]],
